								kind: "troparion",
								text: "<p>Having struggled in fasting upon the mountain, * thou didst destroy the nœtic hordes of the enemy * with the weaponry of the Cross, O most blessed one. * And thou didst likewise manfully array thyself for battle, * slaying Copronymus with the sword of faith. ** And for both thou hast been crowned by God, ** O ever-memorable venerable martyr Dometius.</p>",
								type: "1",
